# Find Photos — standalone product

This repo is a **separate commercial product**, extracted from HSF club portal. Do not rebuild HSF payments, meetings, convocations, or member dashboards here.

## Vision
- Organizer uploads event photos → guest finds themselves via selfie/QR → downloads only their matches.
- Target: Somalia / region first (schools, clubs, weddings, campus, conferences). Local edge: Somali+English UX, WhatsApp-friendly, simple pricing — not “first in world.”
- Global peers exist (SnapSeek, SnapFind, Eventiere, InItPic); compete on local fit.

## Roles (product)
- **Organizer / Media Admin**: events, upload, gallery, delete downloaded photos, who-downloaded history.
- **Guest**: privacy consent → selfie/upload → matches → download. Prefer no heavy account for MVP guests.
- **No** HSF-style “My Dashboard” for organizers — home is **Media Gallery**; also Profile/Settings.

## Tech stance
- MVP AI is already in-browser: `@vladmandic/face-api` descriptors + distance match.
- Do **not** add paid cloud face APIs (AWS Rekognition etc.) unless scale/accuracy forces it.
- Stronger server-side index is optional later (time/hosting), not a launch blocker.

## Separation status
- Kit copied from HSF; still needs thin standalone Flask app + own auth when building the real product.
- Keep HSF’s live copy independent; this repo is the product line.
